works.d:
Ühele lehele paigutatud  2 lehte:
vasakpoolsel leheküljel on tekst;
parempoolsel majade katused;

works.de:
2 sheets placed on one leaf:
on the left-hand page there is text;
on the right-hand side, rooftops of houses;

works.d:
Tumepruunid nahkkaaned, esiküljel kaheksakandilise raamistuse loorberioks, , millest vasakul täht "K", paremal "R", ülal: 1865, all "1935".
Auaadressi esiküljel keskel ülal stiliseeritud lillornament, mida läbib lint šriftiga: 21.X 1865-21.X 1935;
kogu ornamendi pinda haarav nr 70.

works.de:
Dark brown leather covers, on the front side an octagonal frame with a laurel branch, to the left of which the letter "K", to the right "R", above: 1865, below "1935".
On the front of the address of honour, in the centre above, a stylised floral ornament, through which runs a ribbon with the script: 21.X 1865-21.X 1935;
no. 70 encompassing the whole surface of the ornament.
